{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "171eed4ad09811460a34676d6318f9ad1a97c51ac389346b4b4c3c7c4a596994", "ja": "灼熱少女、ブレイズアップ！", "zh": "『灼热少女』Blaze up！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "07b6ab0e2a46da5d32d9f499651ada5bfc3760e53c9bef00ae94e3717bfcb30d", "ja": "仲間に迷惑をかけられない、絶対に公演を\n失敗させられないと考えていた琴葉。そんな\n琴葉に、迷惑をかけていい、頼って欲しいと\n告げるメンバー。胸の内を明かし合った\n5人の心は、再びひとつとなった。", "zh": "琴叶认定不能给伙伴添麻烦，\n绝对不能让公演失败；\n成员们则希望琴叶可以依靠她们，\n即使造成麻烦也无妨。\n互相倾诉心中想法后，五人再次团结一心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7ce9dd4f888dc34fa0aa9c82a717f4639bbc3b913072672c3261677676a9f7c", "ja": "さて、琴葉と話す前に……\nみんな、少しだけ、ここで待っていてくれないか？", "zh": "那么，在跟琴叶谈话前……\n大家可以在这里稍等我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "1ccbe96495726ba21850c96758c0853785a9b61dc3aa3a5e7766962d5df87f1f", "ja": "なんで？\nたまき達、ことはと話しちゃダメなの？", "zh": "为什么？\n环我们不能跟琴叶说话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1fa72149d5eb0f14745772002628aa78028826f0ee9e15002a4c9f1db8e9045f", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないよ。でもいきなり大勢で\n押しかけたら、琴葉が話しにくいかもしれないからな。", "zh": "不是，没有不能喔。但是突然这么多人过去，\n琴叶可能会很难说出心里话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "9acb97fe56966c481b1047a517e82bc1d834f025b89d40d2b1a46f972a7df503", "ja": "ん……そうだね。わかった。\nとりあえずまかせるよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯……说得也是，我知道了。\n就先交给你吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "9757b8177f4e9fd62b5571684dedab3bdd2b67eca99bfeaae4629a2573615f78", "ja": "それじゃ私たちは、ここで待ってますね。\n{$P$}さん、ごゆっくり～。", "zh": "那我们就在这里等喔。\n{$P$}先生，请跟她慢慢谈吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "141244e63d420a8ffe6e0d1713f7a61e422e4de2d94b3be5094004a55da0000d", "ja": "お待たせ、琴葉。", "zh": "让你久等了，琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "5c01cb0be4619b35f8ef4aa97b9230213f688cb966720aa766044129d0fde238", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあの、恵美は……みんなは、どうでした？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n那个，惠美呢……还有大家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "86a8eaff4c431dbb65dcefc4a2356af0f67a44488c94913b14813e529bb5435c", "ja": "大丈夫だ、みんなには控え室で待ってもらっている。\nそれより、さっきの話が途中だったからな。", "zh": "放心，我请大家在准备室等我们了。\n不说这个了，我们刚刚事情才谈到一半吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "263a9457fcecdb89354dabb36a98243bd0958a412a08b003827ddf0e7cefe81a", "ja": "話？", "zh": "事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "33ff8bc7d8a7b10fad5d2739e299b45873c549da90ae535532402099b54ded5f", "ja": "最初に言っておく。どうしても自信がないと言うなら、\nリーダーもセンターも、やめたっていい。", "zh": "我先讲结论，如果你无论如何都没有自信，\n你可以辞退队长和Center的职务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "f2a0e2650916924a2cda3734f3c5992c3403fa6eaebe6434f0e8f53b709b66af", "ja": "い、いえ。なんでもありません……。", "zh": "没、没事，没什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5a61b4d14ab92c813e1d1246ca701d408cbd1d28db4c3f616e13c4ca342c0371", "ja": "みんながどんなに続けてほしいと言っても、\n本人が納得できないなら、どうしようもないからな。", "zh": "毕竟不管大家再怎么希望你继续做下去，\n只要你自己不能接受，我们也无法勉强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "92ce5abc18d5b1b210c8dfd36e84df5a10155aed5ae4aadd44a9b73568bbb636", "ja": "その上で、改めて聞かせてほしい。\nどうして琴葉は、リーダーとセンターを降りたいんだ？", "zh": "在这个前提之下，我想再问你一次。\n琴叶你为什么想辞退队长与Center的职务？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "f846fa9bcc3890e619289e1f71cbcf71015d3836f6bb9e865f9fa97f8978689e", "ja": "それは……さっきも言ったとおり、\n私では、実力不足だと思ったからで……。", "zh": "这……就像我刚才说的一样，\n因为我认为自己实力不足……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "ac486a762c59139615b50101a0a5444847e9eec388aeecb5e6463569200b8c27", "ja": "公演を絶対に成功させるには、\n恵美や海美ちゃんに交代したほうが……。", "zh": "如果要保证公演成功，\n最好还是换成惠美或海美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "49325f38213083a3cfc7f3de2ba437be8e50be243536bb8d0c5e01a07b48b4d1", "ja": "そうか。なら、聞き方を変えようか。琴葉はどうして、\n公演を絶対に成功させなきゃと思ってるんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，那我换个方式问你吧。\n琴叶你为什么觉得一定要保证公演成功？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "2d100880ffabeadfb951c43d5c82a1b1155c072ecc83d343e353426d011ff822", "ja": "えっ？　そ、それは、劇場の公演ですし……\n失敗したら、お客さんや、みんなにも迷惑が……。", "zh": "咦？因、因为是剧场的公演……\n如果失败了，会给观众和大家添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "772ddc0438037b4bf6243e0ddb3c29e01839998e24db30c640efae55407d14e5", "ja": "だーかーらー！　迷惑くらいかけたっていいじゃん！\nいい加減、わかんないかな～。", "zh": "就～说～了～！给我们添麻烦也没关系啊！\n你差不多该明白了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "200a6c36e65e47102efefd9be0b4b59d247a55807854b19037b05be6fa92eac5", "ja": "えっ……あっ、恵美！？", "zh": "咦……啊，惠美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1780aa5a2af791a088518c865ff6e51e3281c500e999ed80e15ce0b9f66c4403", "ja": "こらこら、恵美。\nおとなしく待ってろって言ったのに……。", "zh": "喂喂喂，惠美，\n我不是叫你们乖乖等着吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "4b703d7dfecff98c0d8e5209ed7ea78feca7f32f5ba9ce156ff726942273e006", "ja": "にゃはは、ゴメンゴメン！　みんなが、\nどうしてもジッとしてられないって言うからさ～。", "zh": "呀哈哈，抱歉抱歉！\n因为大家都说实在是坐不住嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "326c471d20c2ca6958ae17df96d2ee8a521a0666c4299df3bda7f498c94dbec3", "ja": "ことは！　ことはがダンス忘れちゃったら、\nたまきが助けてあげるね！", "zh": "琴叶！如果你忘了舞步，\n环会帮你的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "7106adf27059a8cb6a46259372ae503bcc7c1fe4089b51a9ff59c7e6dea3c9b8", "ja": "た、環ちゃん！\nということは、もしかして……。", "zh": "小、小环！\n也就是说，难道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "27b8a3405663b9525c33aa4e79deaadfa8b3dec6ba8c9f7da16b0ee9dda62c70", "ja": "琴葉がMC忘れちゃったら、また私が喋ってあげる！\n大丈夫、バッチリ注目させちゃうよっ☆", "zh": "琴叶如果忘了主持要说什么，我会再帮你解围！\n放心，我一定会让每一只眼睛都看过来的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "9f5a9b36247e0563be1183663f5d32ffeb4f9bcb668f6be193e0162d234e54da", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん。私達みんな、\n琴葉ちゃんに、迷惑をかけられたいんですよ。", "zh": "琴叶，我们所有人都想被你添麻烦喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "43e07ac9c9b1cc2761606af504856db326f0d894fd606c056fb00237b0d986aa", "ja": "美也……。ど、どうして……？", "zh": "美也……为、为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "b020f41acf45e0fa8c01346168052831b95fef55be005e023077f2a02dda1fd0", "ja": "だって琴葉ちゃんは、私達の面倒を、\nいつもたくさんみてくれますし～。それに……。", "zh": "因为琴叶平常照顾我们很多啊～\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "36eb1be4e5b31499d3bc712c4c6bd168fc323830cc1f12c4e4e1bfff89868bfc", "ja": "たまきたちみんな、ことはのこと、だーいすきだもん！\nね、めぐみ！", "zh": "而且环我们通通都最～喜欢琴叶了嘛！\n对吧，惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "486af31854896e4597eaf9eefc6f4a344b34ec47d183b5150f7eea14ac3ee8a7", "ja": "うっ！\n……そ、そうっ！　大好きで悪い！？", "zh": "唔！\n……对、对啦！我最爱你了不行吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "8f63a02d4b53d37a1e74fa7c82b16247570ff98c6e39dd8dadb1ff618e21ddcb", "ja": "だって、琴葉♪\n私も、琴葉のコトだーいすきだよっ！", "zh": "听到了吧，琴叶♪\n我也最～喜欢琴叶啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "e50096c63715788832fa4db91c1d98b3ac4ac018e1fb63d50d0d4471304bf951", "ja": "恵美、海美ちゃん……環ちゃん、美也……。\nごめんね……私も……。", "zh": "惠美、海美……小环、美也……\n对不起……我也一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "dfa4fa40902f200d9faca82c63bba9619ec7106f392bc8aa53476620baf1b263", "ja": "私も、みんなのことが、大好き……！", "zh": "我也最爱大家了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "7b490b30810e9e352ecb9ff360faa363b19107b075a5df47c3cb1947ffd5d9e4", "ja": "あっ！？　も、もー！　琴葉ってば、何泣いてんの！？\n{$P$}、何とか言ってやって！", "zh": "啊！？讨、讨厌！琴叶你哭什么啊！？\n{$P$}，你快说点话安慰她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8ff3fb8200456ea15ec78f62c9425171b95f58698f295214cb1a3b77cf4aaff1", "ja": "琴葉。確かに、本番は大事だよ。\n失敗が許されない場面だって当然あるだろう。", "zh": "琴叶，正式演出的确很重要，\n当然也会有不允许失败的场合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "e0229f97c500da353796938d4d361569cfd4f418cb8fa6d450d7c1630ce5b18d", "ja": "でも失敗を糧に成長できるなら、\n俺は失敗だって意味も価値もあると思うよ。", "zh": "但如果能将失败化为经验进而成长，\n我认为即使失败了，也是有意义的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "bda5366bb202b8f7d6152eb86b580f0878e9392f0ff9602c3c049784f3c8e54a", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\n少し、肩の力が抜けました。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢你。\n我的心情轻松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "67d4e42f313cd9bbe68d9403925db397676461802e15d5c383908e2a34f4a001", "ja": "改めてお願いします。{$P$}、私に\n灼熱少女のリーダーとセンターを、やらせてください。", "zh": "{$P$}，我要再次拜托你。\n请让我担任『灼热少女』的队长与Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "4037eab7bb4453343b9cc614eecae04d8170ee360b8add6fcba450e2ab4c45a1", "ja": "まだまだ、アイドルとしては未熟ですけど……\nこの5人でなら、きっとやりきれると思います！", "zh": "虽然我还不是一个足够成熟的偶像……\n但有我们五个人一起，一定能够完成公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "b645a9e78bc64cee95829bef6a042c0d981bad6a41c9a92e8ea3e2d12b50b294", "ja": "そうか。なら、よろしく頼む！\nそうだな、5人ならきっと大丈夫だ。信じてるよ。", "zh": "这样啊，那就拜托你了！\n也对，你们五个人一定没问题，我相信你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "96198004b43c5c33b65619fa837fd6df0ebc6a7c3fe148ca0d4eabacd3eaee5c", "ja": "やったあーーっ！！　灼熱少女、ふっかーつ！", "zh": "太好了──！！『灼热少女』复活！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1043_040tam", "source_sha256": "55f63482e9d5851249243eee4520a5a12bfb0f8bf862eaede842f0fce3d47e32", "ja": "わ～いっ！　たまき、みんなで歌うの、\nすっごく楽しみだぞ～。くふふ♪", "zh": "耶～！环非常期待大家一起唱歌喔～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "3d1036ffcd45a8679fb78d336022d9b3b08f17ce465618d72ffd4cee22dab7c6", "ja": "ぱちぱちぱち～。琴葉ちゃん、\nこれからも末永くよろしくお願いします～。", "zh": "拍拍手～琴叶，\n今后也请多多指教，直到天长地久啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "5252085d816d59ae23c6f130df5307de7bbb093eca0f7e4a7a38c7259a7f1230", "ja": "ありがとう、みんな！　私、『灼熱少女』のメンバーで\n……みんなとユニットを組めて、本当によかった……。", "zh": "谢谢你们！我能成为『灼热少女』的成员……\n能跟大家一起组成团体，真的是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "fc722ce864f2ce895fc67784e4235bcf8e0a84f84eeadb23d77bbfa2255fbe1f", "ja": "にゃはは、そういうの気が早いって、琴葉！\n本番は、まだこれからなんだからさっ♪", "zh": "呀哈哈，现在说这种话还太早了，琴叶！\n我们接下来才要开始正式活动呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "9874922e62d504e04c24586e45bba3150eb9b44e0b4fb14749cc0464cbc5aff8", "ja": "そっか。……そうだね。ふふっ！", "zh": "这样啊……说得也是，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "310b4c2eb35dd4e8a6baaa1af029e56839f09c67e13d51aab33047cc4509d51a", "ja": "みんなの気持ちがひとつになったところで……\n掛け声いくよっ！　琴葉、音頭取って！　ほらほらっ。", "zh": "在大家团结一心的时候……一起喊口号吧！\n琴叶，你来带头！快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1049_017kth", "source_sha256": "6db029a9bdbac4d869ab438983b75ccfea73c48b57e7eb888f170ec64f60224e", "ja": "う、うん。それじゃ……。\n灼熱少女……！", "zh": "嗯，好的。那么……\n『灼热少女』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_06_1050_017kth", "source_sha256": "d0a372607fa85447a86c2bd5eca1707f1d9f01f35e87a3bbdf85dd4f334feeaa", "ja": "ブレイズ・アーーーップ！！！", "zh": "Blaze u───p！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
